hen-not (or (contains? fixed n)\n                      (and variadic-from (>= n variadic-from)))\n          (refuse! op :arity {::argc n}))\n        (apply f args)))))\n\n\n(def data-module\n  \"The `data` module's exports, export symbol to host function.\"\n  (into {}\n        (map (fn [[op arities f]] [op (arity-checked op arities f)]))\n        exports))\n(defn machine-data?\n  \"`plain-data?` for a value inside a machine payload: a closure or a\n   continuation, a host type only a kernel mints, counts as its payload,\n   as the plain map it was before D7. Rows and code datoms stay\n   `plain-data?`, plus the exact-integer big carriers (ruling 4).\"\n  [x]\n  (or (nil? x)\n      (if (values/host-typed? x)\n        (machine-data? (values/payload x))\n        (and (cond (or (boolean? x) (number? x)\n                       (integer-host/big-carrier? x) (cbor/float64? x)\n                       (string? x) (keyword? x) (symbol? x))\n                   true\n                   (map? x) (and (every? machine-data? (keys x))\n                                 (every? machine-data? (vals x)))\n                   (coll? x) (every? machine-data? x)\n                   :else false)\n             (machine-data? (meta x))))))\n\n\n106:                          (= 'yin/def (get-in node [:operator :name])))\n107:                 (get-in node [:operands 0 :value])))\n133:            f (get-in entry [:slice (symbol (name n))])]\n135:            :yin.k/effects (get (:callable-effects registry) f #{})}]))))\n36:Done: (1) Owner granted the master push (acfa7ccd..750dd505) and approved sonnet routing for 3b; owner burn-window relay recorded (\"push claude hard... expiring tomorrow\"). (2) Slice 3b implemented by sonnet (engineer session via claude CLI, brief collab/1793203263776): argument-vector convention per fable's binding shape, 5 P3 fixes, oracle harness (register-definition both arities/placements, data module), 4 ledger rows. Engineer deviations disclosed: invocation helper is 